schema PeerContextMessage
owner cmd/BonfyreParticipation/src/peer_facets.c
generation peer-message-1

field facet
  type context-identity
  required true

field sender
  type person-subject
  required true

field recipient
  type person-subject
  required true

field nonce
  type digest-fragment
  required true

field body
  type bounded-text
  required true

invariant current-mutual-permission
  statement a message may be sent and read only for the current mutual choice and participation revisions in its context

invariant exact-retry
  statement a sender nonce can acknowledge only an identical message to the same recipient, context and consent revisions

forbidden_inference a private message -> a public post, dating enrollment or permission in a different context
